# Stripe (optional — without this, checkout runs in demo mode)
# Get your keys at https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
# Use sk_test_... for development; sk_live_... for production.
# Never commit a live secret key to source control.
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...

# Capacitor live server (optional)
# CAP_SERVER_URL=https://your-app.vercel.app

# Beta feedback email — FormSubmit delivers beta comments here.
# Both values must name the same inbox:
# - BETA_FEEDBACK_EMAIL is used by the server.
# - VITE_BETA_FEEDBACK_EMAIL is bundled into the client for direct FormSubmit
#   and mail-app fallback. It is public configuration, not a secret.
# If both are unset, the app defaults to bpcca@icloud.com.
# BETA_FEEDBACK_EMAIL=you@example.com
# VITE_BETA_FEEDBACK_EMAIL=you@example.com
#
# FormSubmit one-time activation:
#   1. Configure both variables with the same destination inbox.
#   2. Deploy/run the app and submit one beta comment.
#   3. Open FormSubmit's confirmation email and activate the form (check spam).
#   4. Submit again and confirm automatic delivery.
# Any FormSubmit failure—including activation, configuration, or network
# failure—requests a pre-filled mail-app handoff. The comment remains on-device.
